# What stays out of the image. Without this file the context carries node_modules and the whole .git.
.git
.github
node_modules
data
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.*
*.md
# Test-only code, including engine/tests/hooks/scoped-roles.js, which wraps rolesOf so one fixed
# address holds triage and approve on chosen pages. `node --import` reads NODE_OPTIONS, so a hook of
# that shape reachable inside a running container is one environment variable away from a backdoor.
# `Dockerfile`'s `COPY engine ./engine` ships everything under `engine/` unless this line excludes
# it. Nothing in the image needs it: `CMD` runs `engine/api/server.ts` directly, and the HEALTHCHECK
# is a plain fetch — see workflows.test.js's "the image ships no test hooks".
engine/tests
